# Nothing here is required: the lab runs on public data with no credentials.
# It exists so that a fork can point the same models at a different warehouse
# without editing committed files.
#
# Copy to .env and export, or pass on the command line.

# Absolute path to the DuckDB file. Required only for `edr report`, which runs
# dbt from inside its own package directory (a relative path there creates a
# second, empty database). `make elementary` sets this for you.
DQ_WAREHOUSE=

# Override the pinned months, e.g. a single month:
#   dbt build --vars '{trips_path: "data/raw/yellow_tripdata_2025-01.parquet"}'
